ob</b><br/>\nVelvet: I'm working here in this shop. Are you interested in any of our goods?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nVelvet: I am Velvet. How can I help you?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nVelvet: It's 3:29 am, my lady/sire.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>buy / offer / goods / shop</b><br/>\nVelvet: I sell pillows and tapestries. Ask me for a {trade} if you're interested to see my wares.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trade</b><br/>\nVelvet: I'm sorry, <i>player</i>, but you need a Premium account to buy furniture. OR Have a look.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nVelvet: Good bye, <i>player</i>.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Velvet</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32943,"y":32104,"z":6}}